Package: mbpr
Type: Package
Title: Meningioma Breakpoint Recurrence Research Scoring
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Dunbar", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "research-software@example.org")
Description: Deterministic normalization, quality control, feature extraction,
    research scoring, and external validation for meningioma segment-level
    copy-number data. This package is for research use only and is not intended
    for clinical diagnosis, grading, treatment selection, or patient management.
